# Arkaon participation contract (no authority expansion) ??JJAJANGNARA

Arkaon handles ops audit/search context. When beom/GPT edit or analyze, leave admin notice, Change Intent DNA, and light peer review.
Member/customer navigation DNA stays separate from change DNA.

## Forbidden
- No expanded payment/refund/sanction/PII mutate authority
- No secrets/tokens/raw values in DNA/visits/reviews
- ARKAON_AGENT_HANDOFF_SECRET / X-ARKAON-AGENT-KEY is a capability key (not a role)

## Required procedure
1. Announce visit before start (agent-visits/announce) ??purpose/areas/requests
2. Search report / wake / no-touch / change-dna / cross-checks when possible
3. After edits, record Change Intent DNA
4. Meaningful changes: peer review (author != reviewer: beom<->gpt)
5. Close visit at end

## Wake
Wake only while concurrent visitors are present; suggest edits, never auto-execute.

## Host profile
Check host-profile first. If API host exists (Railway etc.), secrets belong on API host.
Netlify Functions-only products use Netlify env. Fallback: .arkaon/participation

## API (this product)
- Base: /api/admin/arkaon/participation
- host-profile for secret-scope notice (values never printed)
- Local fallback: .arkaon/participation/ or commit/session summary

## Layers
| Layer | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| visit | visits/requests/work split |
| change_dna | code change context |
| cross_check | beom<->GPT peer review |
| wake | concurrent presence |
| readiness / no-touch | settings / banned prefixes |

## Payment / AML pre-brief (required)

Before payment/settlement/payout work, open AML guidance for this product.
Arkaon may analyze and propose only. AML approval, payout/refund execution, status guessing, and secret/PII reporting are forbidden.
Phase A keeps live payout gate unwired (INICIS_OPENMALL_AML_LIVE_GATE_WIRED=false).

## Evidence-backed collaboration rules

Record Work Contract scope, no-touch, completion criteria, and test plan before work.
Do not report no_evidence/stalled as in-progress execution.
Commits/tests/CI/deploy need reference + HEAD SHA proof. HQ alone confirms decisions and risk acceptance.